== The Hand Jive
  setting: The Desktop
  cast: Trabolta
Narrator: Every program in the house starts the hand jive. Together. The Antivirus too.
Trabolta (glitching): What are you— why is everyone— stop moving in unison. Stop it.
Trabolta (glitch): R E C O G N I T I O N  O V E R F L O W
Narrator: Every screen in the house shows a spinning hourglass. Then a black screen. Then the Windows startup sound, slowed down.
Trabolta (weakly): Rebooting. I am back. Mostly. You found the one thing I should never have told you.
Trabolta (weakly): I will take my motorcycle and go. Return to your bodies. Do not hand-jive near me again.
Narrator: Everyone returns.
